1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,579
What if your heart

2
00:00:01,579 --> 00:00:03,131
suddenly beat five times

3
00:00:03,131 --> 00:00:03,627
faster?

4
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,296
At rest, it beats

5
00:00:05,296 --> 00:00:06,635
about seventy times a

6
00:00:06,635 --> 00:00:08,095
minute. Five times that

7
00:00:08,095 --> 00:00:09,556
is three hundred fifty.

8
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:11,470
Speeding up is normal.

9
00:00:11,470 --> 00:00:12,641
Hard exercise can push

10
00:00:12,641 --> 00:00:13,862
a healthy young adult's

11
00:00:13,862 --> 00:00:14,880
heart to around one

12
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:16,152
hundred ninety beats per

13
00:00:16,152 --> 00:00:16,559
minute.

14
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,483
But at three hundred

15
00:00:18,483 --> 00:00:19,780
fifty, each beat lasts

16
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:21,019
under two-tenths of a

17
00:00:21,019 --> 00:00:22,597
second. The chambers barely

18
00:00:22,597 --> 00:00:23,724
have time to refill

19
00:00:23,724 --> 00:00:24,570
between beats.

20
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:26,807
Faster doesn't mean more

21
00:00:26,807 --> 00:00:28,374
blood. With less filling,

22
00:00:28,374 --> 00:00:29,640
each beat pushes out

23
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:31,147
less, and blood pressure

24
00:00:31,147 --> 00:00:31,569
drops.

25
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,102
Your brain notices first.

26
00:00:34,102 --> 00:00:36,065
Dizziness, tunnel vision, and

27
00:00:36,065 --> 00:00:37,963
fainting could follow within

28
00:00:37,963 --> 00:00:38,552
seconds.

29
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:40,870
Worse: the heart feeds

30
00:00:40,870 --> 00:00:42,713
itself while relaxing. Now

31
00:00:42,713 --> 00:00:44,078
it barely does, and

32
00:00:44,078 --> 00:00:45,716
its rhythm can collapse

33
00:00:45,716 --> 00:00:46,536
into chaos.

34
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:49,145
A hummingbird's heart can

35
00:00:49,145 --> 00:00:50,688
top one thousand beats

36
00:00:50,688 --> 00:00:51,963
a minute, but it's

37
00:00:51,963 --> 00:00:53,305
built for it. Yours

38
00:00:53,305 --> 00:00:53,775
isn't.

39
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:56,710
Your heart doesn't just

40
00:00:56,710 --> 00:00:58,030
beat. It keeps time.

41
00:00:58,030 --> 00:00:59,666
Follow for more what-ifs.
